@startuml
actor Operator
participant GUI
participant RunService
participant ScanOrchestrator
participant "Device Worker" as Worker
participant CommandPolicy
participant EvidenceStore
participant CheckEngine
database SQLite
Operator -> GUI: Start audit
GUI -> RunService: create run + snapshots
RunService -> SQLite: AuditRun / RunDevice
GUI -> ScanOrchestrator: run(targets, concurrency)
loop each device, bounded
  ScanOrchestrator -> Worker: collect
  Worker -> CommandPolicy: validate every command
  Worker -> EvidenceStore: atomic UTF-8 writes + SHA-256
  Worker -> CheckEngine: parse and evaluate
  Worker -> RunService: outcome, facts, results, artifact links
  RunService -> SQLite: persist structured records
  Worker --> GUI: queued ScanEvent
end
RunService -> EvidenceStore: finalize device files + manifest
RunService -> SQLite: final status/counts
GUI --> Operator: results and history
@enduml
